Description: local web console and runtime for Bianbu Agent
 Bianbu Agent is a YAML-configured agent runtime with a FastAPI web
 console, command-line management, plugin hosting, MCP integration and
 file-backed storage. This package includes a locked Python environment
 so installing the package does not need to download Python dependencies.
